<li>KDE</li>
<li>GNOME</li>
<li>fvwm</li>
<li>AfterStep</li>
<li>twm (window manager buatan X.Org sendiri)</li>
</ul>
Implementasi X Window System ada XFree86 dan X.Org Server.
